            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nel blocco di codice del ciclo <code>for</code>, aggiungi <code>~</code> alla variabile <code>line</code> usando l'operatore <code>+=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;*&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += \" /><text value=\"&quot;~&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(line)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"*\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>"
